{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/2d88eff7bdccab2c13e0345dd3bcc3a3.poster.avif?t=1766153696\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/2d88eff7bdccab2c13e0345dd3bcc3a3.webm?t=1766153696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/2d88eff7bdccab2c13e0345dd3bcc3a3.mp4?t=1766153696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Neon-infused katana action in a fever dream Tokyo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Tokyo's criminal underground as the feared &quot;Shinjuku Vampire&quot; Kobayashi and take out crazy lunatics for just the right price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0c72bcb4a74a45d0a8a1467398239648.poster.avif?t=1766153696\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0c72bcb4a74a45d0a8a1467398239648.webm?t=1766153696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0c72bcb4a74a45d0a8a1467398239648.mp4?t=1766153696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\u30fbUnrelenting katana combat:</strong> Slash, stab and parry your way through hordes of monsters inspired by Japanese demons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbBlood is the key to survival:</strong> Use 10 different blood skills to overcome challenging enemies, then suck in their blood to replenish your health and skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbFever dream Tokyo:</strong> Explore neon-drenched renditions of real places like Shinjuku, Akihabara or Shibuya</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbEnjoy Tokyo's nighlife:</strong> Between missions you can relax in your own apartment in Shinjuku, buy decorations and play minigames in the city hub</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbBecome Unstoppable:</strong> Upgrade your ability tree to become stronger and unlock new abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbHand drawn comic:</strong> A bizarre story with crazy characters brought to live in dynamic comic scenes drawn by Hans \u201cHeavy Metal Hanzo\u201d Steinbach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbThanks, Andrew:</strong> Over 2 hour of original electronic music composed by the legendary Andrew Hulshult </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0cc4d38576adf6a5969746c671cf6052.poster.avif?t=1766153696\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0cc4d38576adf6a5969746c671cf6052.webm?t=1766153696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0cc4d38576adf6a5969746c671cf6052.mp4?t=1766153696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Deep Tokyo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2063090/ceddfc6f040d0fa6dd11e0bcddb2dec5cb207c24.jpg"},{"name":"Sumio Hara","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2063090/ca31a02aecb177e823cd19f3a533266bec1b5610.jpg"},{"name":"Terajima","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2063090/5b25c2d03d715d4db6edb7de65837ea6d623f9b4.jpg"},{"name":"Stay Hydrat